> Inspect the actual experiment results

Noisy reward and optimal-action histories are saved alongside all nine cumulative regret curves. Gaussian and Bernoulli testbeds have different reward scales; compare policies within each testbed.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/bandit_algorithms_results.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
